sequenceDiagram
    actor Employee
    participant Browser
    participant Auth as Supabase Auth
    participant Google
    participant API as Edge API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    Employee->>Browser: Continue with Google
    Browser->>Auth: Start OAuth with PKCE
    Auth->>Google: Identity request
    Google-->>Auth: Verified identity
    Auth-->>Browser: Callback and session
    Browser->>API: Check membership or accept invitation with token
    API->>Auth: Validate token and obtain trusted user
    API->>DB: Check active membership or match valid invitation
    alt Active member or invited employee
        DB-->>API: Existing or atomically created membership
        API-->>Browser: Workspace and role
    else No valid invitation
        API-->>Browser: Access not granted
    end
